OL,3,A'Good for the people' if politicians
OL,4,Astopped doing media, says NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state for Northern
OL,7,FIreland has said that if politicians
OL,8,Fstayed off the media for a month it
OL,9,Fwould "probably be very good for the
OL,10,Fpeople".
OL,12,FSir Chris Bryant said it breaks his
OL,13,Fheart that because of the crisis over
OL,14,Fagreeing a budget he can't get round to
OL,15,Fissues like violence against women and
OL,16,Fgirls, or resolving community tensions.
OL,18,FHe told a committee of MPs that was
OL,19,F"one of the symbols of the kind of
OL,20,Fcomplete abnormality that now seems to
OL,21,Fpervade Northern Ireland politics".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
