OL,3,A'Good for the people' if politicians
OL,4,Astopped doing media, says NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response to the comments, Stormont's
OL,7,FFinance Minister John O'Dowd said that
OL,8,FSir Chris had continued to respond to
OL,9,F"cold hard facts and figures with
OL,10,Fbluster and theatrics".
